---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import siteConfig from '../data/siteConfig.json';

const tiers = [
  {
    title: 'A Hot Meal on a Rainy Day — €10',
    amount: '€10',
    jp: '一椀の糧',
    description:
      'Provides warm soup, bread, dried figs, and hot tea after a soaked day of walking through mountain passes.',
  },
  {
    title: "A Night's Pilgrim Bunk — €20",
    amount: '€20',
    jp: '一夜の宿',
    description:
      'Covers a simple municipal albergue bunk, a warm shower, and an electrical outlet to write the week’s dispatch.',
  },
  {
    title: 'A Pair of Trail Socks / Gear Repair — €35',
    amount: '€35',
    jp: '草鞋と修繕',
    description:
      'Replaces worn sandal straps, wool socks, or thread and wax to keep the pack intact across thousands of kilometers.',
  },
  {
    title: 'Custom Osettai Offering — Any Amount',
    amount: 'Open',
    jp: '随意のお接待',
    description:
      'An open-handed blessing of any size toward trail provisions, border visas, or the preservation of this archive.',
  },
];
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Offer Osettai (Donate) | CAMINO HENRO"
  description="Support the Camino Henro pilgrimage from Spain to Japan in the traditional spirit of Shikoku Osettai and Camino donativo."
>
  <!-- Centered Crimson Stamp Header -->
  <!-- STANDARDIZED_SCROLL_HEADER_START -->
<div class="scroll-title-block">
  <div class="scroll-eyebrow">お接待 • Pilgrimage Alms</div>
  <h1 class="page-heading">Offer Osettai</h1>
  <div class="page-subtitle">Sustaining the digital scroll, off-trail archiving, and the future printed book of essays</div>
</div>

<div class="page-break">
  <div class="line"></div>
  <div class="kanji">志</div>
  <div class="line"></div>
</div>
<!-- STANDARDIZED_SCROLL_HEADER_END -->

  <!-- Long-Form Cultural & Philosophical Explanation -->
  <section class="py-8 border-b border-[#1C1A17]/15">
    <div class="essay-prose">
      <p>
        On the island of Shikoku, where pilgrims in woven sedge hats walk the circular path linking eighty-eight sacred temples, there lives a centuries-old custom known as <strong><em>Osettai</em> (お接待)</strong>. Local villagers, farmers, and shopkeepers step out to press a tangerine, a cup of green tea, a rice ball, or a small paper envelope of coins into the hands of a passing walker. It is never a commercial transaction, nor is it charity given out of pity; in Buddhist understanding, the householder who cannot leave their fields shares directly in the spiritual merit and inquiry of the pilgrimage by sustaining the one who walks.
      </p>

      <p>
        Sixteen thousand kilometers to the west, along the medieval tracks of the <em>Camino de Santiago</em> in Spain, the very same spirit endures under the name of <strong><em>donativo</em></strong>—hospitality offered freely so that the table remains full for the next traveler behind you. Both traditions rest upon a quiet, radical premise: that true material security is born not from hoarding behind high walls, but from living inside a web of mutual care.
      </p>

      <p>
        If these dispatches have offered you quiet company, reflection, or a breath of open air, you are invited to participate in this walk through a gesture of digital <em>Osettai</em>. Every contribution goes directly toward sustaining the pilgrimage and its public archive, and every single euro is recorded openly in the project ledger.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- 4 Suggested Contribution Tiers (2x2 Ink-Bordered Grid) -->
  <section class="py-10 border-b border-[#6E2B25]">
    <div class="flex items-baseline justify-between mb-6">
      <h2 class="font-heading text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-[#1C1A17]">
        Suggested Osettai Offerings
      </h2>
      <span class="font-jp text-xs text-[#6E2B25] tracking-widest">喜捨の目安</span>
    </div>

    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-4 mb-8">
      {tiers.map((tier) => (
        <a
          href={siteConfig.stripeDonationUrl}
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
          class="group block border border-[#1C1A17]/25 hover:border-[#6E2B25] bg-[#D8CEB8]/35 hover:bg-[#D8CEB8]/65 p-6 transition-all"
        >
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between font-mono text-xs text-[#6E2B25] mb-2">
            <span>{tier.jp}</span>
            <span class="px-2 py-0.5 border border-[#6E2B25] group-hover:bg-[#6E2B25] group-hover:text-[#E6DFCF] transition-colors">
              {tier.amount}
            </span>
          </div>

          <h3 class="font-heading text-xl font-bold text-[#1C1A17] group-hover:text-[#6E2B25] transition-colors mb-2">
            {tier.title}
          </h3>

          <p class="font-body text-sm sm:text-base text-[#524D46] leading-relaxed mb-4">
            {tier.description}
          </p>

          <span class="font-mono text-[11px] uppercase tracking-widest text-[#6E2B25] group-hover:underline underline-offset-4">
            Select Offering via Stripe →
          </span>
        </a>
      ))}
    </div>

    <!-- Prominent Primary CTA & Transparent Ledger Link -->
    <div class="border border-[#6E2B25] bg-[#D8CEB8]/50 p-6 sm:p-8 text-center">
      <a
        href={siteConfig.stripeDonationUrl}
        target="_blank"
        rel="noopener noreferrer"
        class="inline-block w-full sm:w-auto bg-[#6E2B25] hover:bg-[#8C3B33] text-[#E6DFCF] font-mono text-sm uppercase tracking-widest px-8 py-4 transition-colors mb-4"
      >
        Offer Osettai via Stripe →
      </a>

      <div class="pt-2">
        <a
          href="/finances"
          class="font-mono text-xs text-[#1C1A17] hover:text-[#6E2B25] underline underline-offset-4 transition-colors"
        >
          Every euro received is logged openly in the Financial Ledger →
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
